Facts about the official binaries (function addresses, shader variant counts,
texture bit layout, key-string location) were obtained by inspecting the
shipped SDK 0.495 `YSEmote.dll`/`emotedriver.dll` for interoperability. No
official code or shader source was copied; the WGSL in `src/render.rs` is an
independent description of the observed program semantics; the WGSL files
under `shaders/` are generated from the feature table in `src/render.rs`.

